<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro for the New AK47 Spray, it's only usable with the x8 Attachment

Personally used Settings:

Driver should always be turned on when using the Program
Snap to Window should be off

!!! Important !!!
You should set these in-game /// FOV (graphics.fov 90 in F1) and Sensitivity (input.sensitivity 0.9 in F1)

Mouse used: Trust GXT 95  ///   DPI: 1600
if possible put the Macro on Mouse1
Turn off Minimum Delay in the program settings
Uncheck "Increased Pointer Accuracy" in the program settings

I hope it works for you just as good as for me and have a nice day!</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
